      {
        "text": "Wind, light, lightning, and cloud type Gu are outstanding movement Gu worms; Chasing Wind Gu is rank four and gives a great boost to speed. It contains the Dao mark of wind. Fang Yuan judges that if he used it, his beast phantoms would disturb the Gu and weaken the effect, so it is a poor fit for him.",
